{
  "title": "Anamnesis",
  "subtitle": "The Chronicle of Fundament",
  "author": "Erik Irgens",
  "description": "Seven strangers wake on the road to a northern town with their memories missing and their pockets full of other people's grief. What begins as a season of small mysteries in Triboar — a sickness in the wood, a masked festival, a presence under the graveyard — becomes the chronicle of a war between two women over what may be done with memory itself. A campaign record, a ledger of doors, and a book of secrets: read it slowly, and keep what it gives you.",
